  "title": { "en": "Shopping", "uz": "Xarid", "ru": "Покупки", "tr": "Alışveriş" },
  "goal": {
    "en": "Ask the price, talk about clothes and pay in a shop.",
    "uz": "Narxni so'rang, kiyimlar haqida gapiring va do'konda to'lov qiling.",
    "ru": "Спросите цену, поговорите об одежде и расплатитесь в магазине.",
    "tr": "Fiyat sor, kıyafetler hakkında konuş ve mağazada ödeme yap."
  },
  "guide": "pix",
  "color": "#EC4899",
  "tip": {
    "title": { "en": "How much is it?", "uz": "How much is it?", "ru": "How much is it?", "tr": "How much is it?" },
    "body": {
      "en": "To ask a price, say \"How much is\" + one thing: How much is this jacket? For plural things use \"are\": How much are these shoes? The word \"trousers\" is always plural in English, and shoes come as a pair: these trousers, these shoes. The answer needs \"is\" or \"are\" too: It is fifty dollars. To ask for permission in a shop, start with \"Can I\": Can I try it on?",
      "uz": "Narxni so'rash uchun \"How much is\" + bitta narsa aytiladi: How much is this jacket? Ko'plikda \"are\" ishlatiladi: How much are these shoes? Ingliz tilida trousers doim ko'plikda, shoes esa juft bo'lgani uchun odatda ko'plikda keladi: o'zbekcha \"bu shim\", inglizcha \"these trousers\". Javobda o'zbekchadagi \"turadi\" o'rniga \"is\" yoki \"are\" keladi: It is fifty dollars. Do'konda ruxsat so'rash \"Can I\" bilan boshlanadi: Can I try it on?",
      "ru": "Чтобы спросить цену, говорят \"How much is\" + один предмет: How much is this jacket? Для множественного числа нужно \"are\": How much are these shoes? Как и русское \"брюки\", слово trousers всегда во множественном числе, а shoes (туфли) — это пара, поэтому обычно тоже: these trousers, these shoes. В ответе вместо русского \"стоит\" ставится \"is\" или \"are\": It is fifty dollars. Просьба в магазине начинается с \"Can I\": Can I try it on?",
      "tr": "Fiyat sormak için \"How much is\" + tek bir şey söylenir: How much is this jacket? Çoğul şeyler için \"are\" kullanılır: How much are these shoes? İngilizcede trousers hep çoğuldur, shoes da çift olduğu için genellikle çoğul kullanılır: Türkçedeki \"bu pantolon\" İngilizcede \"these trousers\" olur. Cevapta da \"is\" ya da \"are\" gerekir: It is fifty dollars. Mağazada izin istemek için \"Can I\" ile başla: Can I try it on?"
    },
    "examples": [
      { "en": "How much is this?", "native": { "uz": "Bu qancha turadi?", "ru": "Сколько это стоит?", "tr": "Bu ne kadar?" } },
      { "en": "It is twenty dollars.", "native": { "uz": "Bu yigirma dollar turadi.", "ru": "Это стоит двадцать долларов.", "tr": "Bu yirmi dolar." } },
      { "en": "Can I try it on?", "native": { "uz": "Buni kiyib ko'rsam bo'ladimi?", "ru": "Можно это примерить?", "tr": "Bunu deneyebilir miyim?" } }
    ]
  },
